DESCRIPTION:Award-winning songwriter and powerhouse performer Megan Burtt has a voice that aches\, uplifts\, and lingers long after the last note. A storyteller at heart\, she transforms life’s moments into melody\, weaving emotion and meaning through every song she sings.\nDoors at 6:30 pm.\nDavid Burchfield writes Americana that swaggers wildly through raw emotion within a meticulously written and arranged package. With connections to his indie folk\, classic country\, and bluegrass roots\, Burchfield carves a unique path in the folk rock world with his powerful 5-piece\, the Fire Guild.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/megan-burtt-with-david-burchfield-a-living-room-concert
DTEND:20260307T033000Z
LOCATION:Butterscotch Studios
DTSTART:20260307T013000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [Rock] Megan Burtt with David Burchfield (a living room concert)
UID:d8509ba0-5266-4b9a-bb80-36dd736407fa@d850.org
END:VEVENT
